        "text": "8"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count girls and boys",
        "body": "A girl has at least three sisters, so there are at least $4$ girls. A boy has at least three sisters (fine with $4$ girls) and at least one brother, so there are at least $2$ boys. A girl needs at least one brother, which $2$ boys provide. The minimum is $4+2=6$.\n\n**Answer: (C) 6**"
      }
