    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "A protest march goes through town from the mall (M) to the community centre (CC). If the march can only travel east or south, then the number of different possible routes is: (the town is a grid of $2$ rows and $3$ columns of blocks, M is at the top-left and CC at the bottom-right corner).",
