      {
        "title": "Subsets",
        "body": "Each weight is either used or not: $2^4=16$ choices, minus the choice of using no weights at all, leaves $15$ combinations. They give every whole mass from $1$ kg to $15$ kg.\n\n**Answer: (A) 15**"
      }
    ],
