    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "42 equal sized matchsticks are used to make the figure below. The figure is a parallelogram, which includes the longer diagonal. In how many different ways can you make matching figures using all 42 matchsticks?",
    "image": "qimages/samf/junior-2006-r1/q19.webp",
    "choices": [
